This repository contains a modified derivative of Krea 2: Krea 2 AnyAngles, a
rank-32 spatial Control-LoRA that adds camera-view control for human images.

Use, modification, and distribution of the model weights are subject to the
Krea 2 Community License Agreement included as LICENSE.pdf.

The included reference pipeline is derived from ostris/Krea2OstrisEdit and
contains modifications from the Krea 2 AnyPaint runtime. Pipeline and original
AnyAngles helper code are distributed under Apache License 2.0.

Automatic human-mesh preprocessing uses SAM 3D Body when enabled. SAM 3D Body
is a separate dependency distributed by Meta under the SAM License; its model
weights are not included here. See https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam-3d-body.

Krea 2: https://huggingface.co/krea/Krea-2-Turbo
Upstream edit pipeline: https://huggingface.co/ostris/Krea2OstrisEdit

